From 6ebd27565b3a37401398cfddea8cb491626546e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fable <fable@local>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 13:35:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Batch 8: URL-persist admin deployment + request list filters
 (FND-48)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Roll the useUrlFilters hook (shipped on inventory) to the deployments and requests
admin lists so filters are deep-linkable, reload-safe, and back-button correct.
- deployments: showEnded/operator/project -> URL keys ended/operatorId/projectId
- requests: tab/type/status/hub -> URL; free-text requester stays local (matches
  inventory — avoids per-keystroke URL churn)
- both pages wrapped in <Suspense> (useSearchParams requirement)

Four-agent-reviewed (behavior-preserving vs the prior local state). Hardening from
review: tamperable URL values coerced to the known option set (tab/type/status) and
select value props guarded against out-of-range ids (operator/project/hub) so a stale
or hand-edited param can't disable a filter, blank a control, or flash during the
async options load on a valid deep-link.
